      "en": "but, ‘As the LORD lives, who brought up and who led the offspring of the house of Israel out of the north country, and from all the countries where I had driven them.’ Then they will dwell in their own land.”",
      "ko": "이스라엘 집 자손을 북방 땅, 그 모든 쫓겨났던 나라에서 인도하여 내신 여호와의 사심으로 맹세할 것이며 그들이 자기 땅에 거하리라 하시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "845b80e06032a3c6527b5fb02bfa1ec44da81d1dfdc4d6b9dd15e02682785507",
      "translation_text_hash": "eaaf3870a71a204cc3b246aa99984a3a6c9c560e30336565355613cd25859bf7",
