      "en": "But if they had stood in my council, then they would have caused my people to hear my words, and would have turned them from their evil way, and from the evil of their doings.",
      "ko": "그들이 만일 나의 회의에 참예하였더면 내 백성에게 내 말을 들려서 그들로 악한 길과 악한 행위에서 돌이키게 하였으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "849115303c118bd73df28f8925f3bb6dbbac5ca28aa26590bff8dea0471ec6ae",
      "translation_text_hash": "4f9a3d463a03d2df65f338ab4718d3f4c539f05630d5ef29c7f64bed461b97f3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
